---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility | Zeta"
  description="Learn about Zeta's commitment to providing an accessible, inclusive, and user-friendly website experience."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-compact">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Accessibility</p>

      <h1>Designed for an Inclusive Digital Experience</h1>

      <p>
        Zeta is committed to creating a website that is accessible,
        inclusive, and easy to use for everyone. We continuously improve
        our digital experience to support visitors using different devices,
        browsers, and assistive technologies while working toward recognized
        accessibility standards.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Accessibility Commitment -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell prose">

      <h2>Our Accessibility Commitment</h2>

      <p>
        We believe that access to information should be available to all.
        Accessibility is considered throughout the design, development, and
        maintenance of the Zeta website to help ensure a clear, consistent,
        and inclusive browsing experience.
      </p>

      <h2>Current Accessibility Features</h2>

      <p>
        The website incorporates accessibility best practices, including:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Semantic HTML and properly structured headings</li>
        <li>Keyboard-accessible navigation and visible focus indicators</li>
        <li>Responsive layouts that adapt across screen sizes</li>
        <li>Descriptive page titles, headings, and link text</li>
        <li>Accessible labels and instructions for form controls</li>
        <li>Color choices designed to support readable contrast</li>
        <li>Support for users who prefer reduced motion</li>
        <li>Alternative text for meaningful images where appropriate</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Accessibility Standards</h2>

      <p>
        Zeta aims to align its website with the principles of the
        <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA</strong>,
        recognizing that accessibility is an ongoing process of evaluation,
        improvement, and continuous enhancement.
      </p>

      <h2>Continuous Improvement</h2>

      <p>
        We regularly review our website to identify opportunities for
        improving accessibility, usability, and compatibility with modern
        browsers and assistive technologies. Feedback from visitors plays an
        important role in helping us improve.
      </p>

      <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>

      <p>
        If you experience difficulty accessing any part of this website or
        require information in an alternative format, we encourage you to
        email <a href="mailto:shanervperez@gmail.com">shanervperez@gmail.com</a>
        or use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. We will make reasonable
        efforts to provide the information or assistance you need.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
